---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Voice command router

Usage: voxcmd <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run           Route a phrase ("and then" sequences included) and act on it
  explain       Print the routing trace of a phrase without acting on it
  reply         Answer the open picker or confirm card with a spoken phrase
  listen        Start a listen turn
  stop          End the session and cancel anything open or recording
  session       Voice sessions
  ask           Open a picker, confirm card or hints overlay and print the answer
  wake          The wake-word listener
  integrations  Inspect the integrations
  help          Open the example-phrase picker
  log           Read the logs of phrases and notifications
  timer         Timer units

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
